flowchart LR
    A[Frontend: criar stream] --> B[Backend: POST /api/streams]
    B --> C[Retorna streamKey + URL RTMP]
    C --> D[OBS publica rtmp://localhost:1935/live/streamKey]

    D --> E[Nginx-RTMP on_publish]
    E --> F[Backend callback /api/streams/callback/publish]
    F --> G{streamKey valida?}
    G -->|Nao| H[HTTP 403: publica rejeitada]
    G -->|Sim| I[Marca stream como LIVE]

    I --> J[Exec transcode.sh]
    J --> K{TRANSCODER}
    K -->|ffmpeg| L[transcode-ffmpeg.sh]
    K -->|gstreamer| M[transcode-gstreamer.sh]

    L --> N[gera /tmp/hls/streamKey/master.m3u8]
    M --> N

    N --> O[Frontend watch carrega HLS]
    O --> P[Player HLS.js + Plyr]

    I --> Q[Publica stream.started no RabbitMQ]
    Q --> R[Consumers processam eventos]

    I --> S[Backend emite SSE stream_status/viewers_update]
    S --> O

    D --> T[Streamer encerra transmissao]
    T --> U[Nginx on_publish_done]
    U --> V[Backend callback /publish_done]
    V --> W[Marca stream como ENDED + SSE]
